==========================================================================
VERDICT
==========================================================================
  C(+3) vs D(-3), commanded 64x span : METADATA-ONLY
  A(auto 6.105x) vs B(none)          : BOTH

  C vs D differ ONLY in the file's own account of what it did.
  Every one of 98,898,048 samples is identical across a commanded
  64x exposure span. 47-exposure-liveness read those 21 description
  bytes as evidence about the image and called the path LIVE.

  A/B differs in BOTH regions: 1-count rounding in the pixels
  (6.105x is not a power of two, so the round trip does not land
  on the same bits) plus the same description bytes. C/D is
  exactly identical because 8.0 and 0.125 ARE powers of two and
  the f32 round trip through them is exact.

  LOCALISED to the tone stage by channel 3.
